{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for integrative consultations, resources, and a short guided exercise to center you now.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1720;
      --card:#0b1320;
      --muted:#9aa7b2;
      --accent:#9fbfba;
      --accent-2:#ffd6a5;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --maxw:1100px;
      --radius:12px;
      --shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
      color-scheme: dark;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0;
      background: radial-gradient(1000px 400px at 10% 10%, rgba(159,191,186,0.06), transparent),
                  linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,14,20,1) 0%, rgba(8,12,16,1) 100%),
                  var(--bg);
      color:#eaf2f1;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      line-height:1.45;
      padding:32px 24px;
      box-sizing:border-box;
    }
    header{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#0b1114}
    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}
    nav a[href$="contact.html"]{color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.04), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));}

    main{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:26px auto 80px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}

    .hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius);background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,16,18,0.5), rgba(6,8,10,0.6));padding:28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
    .pattern{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.045;background-image:url("assets/img/pattern.svg");background-repeat:repeat;mix-blend-mode:screen}
    .hero-content{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:18px;align-items:center}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:18px}
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"],textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;color:#eaf2f1}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:8px}
    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent) 0%, var(--accent-2) 100%);color:#081014;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--accent-2)}

    .meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .meta a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}

    footer{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:10px auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}

    /* Reveal animation */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity 420ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1),transform 420ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}

    /* Modal */
    .overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(2,6,10,0.6),rgba(2,6,10,0.85));backdrop-filter:blur(6px);z-index:120}
    .overlay.open{display:flex}
    .modal{width:min(780px,94%);background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(9,14,16,0.9), rgba(6,8,10,0.96));border-radius:12px;padding:18px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}
    .modal header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}
    .modes{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:8px 0}
    .mode-btn{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .mode-btn.active{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:#fff}

    /* Breathing visual */
    .breath-wrap{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}
    .circle{width:140px;height:140px;border-radius:999px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, rgba(255,214,165,0.08), rgba(255,214,165,0.02));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
    .circle .dot{width:48px;height:48px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));border-radius:999px;transition:transform 1200ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .circle.inhale .dot{transform:scale(1.5)}
    .circle.exhale .dot{transform:scale(0.6)}

    .progress{height:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden}
    .bar{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));width:0%}

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width:880px){
      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      header{padding-bottom:8px}
      .hero-content{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .circle{width:110px;height:110px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:600">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px">A human-guided integrative practice • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="index.html">Start</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Conditions</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Philosophy</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Fees</a>
      <a href="about.html">Team</a>
      <a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero card reveal" data-reveal>
      <div class="pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div>
          <h1>Reach out, ask a question, or try a short centering practice now</h1>
          <p class="lead">Whether you want to discuss a tailored plan, a specific concern, or simply take a moment to reorient — we're here to listen. Use the contact form, call, or open the guided exercise below to steady your breath and note an intention.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;align-items:flex-end">
          <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <button class="btn secondary" id="open-practice">Try the short practice</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="grid">
      <section class="card reveal" data-reveal>
        <form id="contact-form" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
          <h2 id="contact-title" style="margin-top:0">Send a note</h2>
          <label for="name">Your name</label>
          <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="A name we can call you by">

          <div class="row">
            <div style="flex:1">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com">
            </div>
            <div style="width:150px">
              <label for="phone">Phone</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
            </div>
          </div>

          <label for="reason">Reason</label>
          <select id="reason" name="reason">
            <option>General inquiry</option>
            <option>Schedule an appointment</option>
            <option>Partnership or referral</option>
            <option>Billing or insurance</option>
          </select>

          <label for="message">Message</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Share what matters — brief details are fine."></textarea>

          <div class="row" style="justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Not an emergency. If you are in crisis, contact local emergency services.</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
              <button type="submit" class="btn">Send message</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn secondary" id="start-practice-2">Open practice</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>
      </section>

      <aside class="card meta reveal" data-reveal>
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Contact & hours</h3>
        <div>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        <div>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)">Office hours: Mon — Fri, 9:00 — 6:00</div>

        <hr style="opacity:0.04;margin:12px 0;border:none;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)">
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">We listen to each person's story and offer educational, integrative guidance. We do not offer emergency services.</div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Visit</h4>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — appointments by booking</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section class="card reveal" data-reveal>
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Partnerships & resources</h3>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:12px">We work with practitioners, community programs, and local clinics. If you'd like to explore shared initiatives, use the form above and choose "Partnership or referral."</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <a href="about.html" class="btn secondary">Learn about our team</a>
        <a href="services.html" class="btn secondary">Programs & sessions</a>
        <a href="pricing.html" class="btn" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f8d7a6,#a7d9c5);color:#061014">See current fees</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Reach us at <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Guided exercise modal -->
  <div class="overlay" id="practice" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="practice-title">
    <div class="modal" role="document">
      <header>
        <div>
          <h2 id="practice-title" style="margin:0">Short centering practice</h2>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Choose a short practice to steady attention. Educational and supportive — not medical advice.</div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn secondary" id="close-practice">Close</button>
      </header>

      <div style="margin-top:12px">
        <div class="modes" role="tablist" aria-label="Practice modes">
          <button class="mode-btn active" data-mode="breath" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Breathing</button>
          <button class="mode-btn" data-mode="journal" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Journaling</button>
          <button class="mode-btn" data-mode="intention" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Intention</button>
        </div>

        <div id="mode-area">
          <!-- Breathing -->
          <div data-panel="breath">
            <div class="breath-wrap">
              <div class="circle" id="circle" aria-hidden="true"><div class="dot"></div></div>
              <div style="flex:1">
                <div id="phase" style="font-weight:600">Ready</div>
                <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Follow the dot: breathe in as it grows, breathe out as it shrinks. Start with a short cycle.</div>
                <div style="margin-top:12px">
                  <div class="progress" aria-hidden="true"><div class="bar" id="bar"></div></div>
                  <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
                    <button class="btn" id="start-breath">Start</button>
                    <button class="btn secondary" id="pause-breath">Pause</button>
                    <button class="btn secondary" id="reset-breath">Reset</button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Journal -->
          <div data-panel="journal" style="display:none">
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
              <div style="font-weight:600">Prompt</div>
              <div style="color:var(--muted)">Write for a few minutes: What feels most important to carry into the next hour?</div>
              <textarea id="journal-text" placeholder="A few sentences, or a line to return to later..."></textarea>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end">
                <button class="btn" id="save-journal">Save</button>
                <button class="btn secondary" id="clear-journal">Clear</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Intention -->
          <div data-panel="intention" style="display:none">
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
              <div style="font-weight:600">Set an intention</div>
              <div style="color:var(--muted)">A short phrase you can revisit. Keep it kind and practical.</div>
              <input id="intention-input" placeholder="e.g., " + "Move patiently through today" style="min-width:0">
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end">
                <button class="btn" id="save-intent">Save intention</button>
                <button class="btn secondary" id="clear-intent">Clear</button>
              </div>
              <div id="intent-saved" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);display:none;margin-top:8px"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    (function(){
      // Year
      document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

      // Scroll reveal with prefers-reduced-motion support
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const reveals = document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]');
      if(prefersReduced){
        reveals.forEach(r => r.classList.add('visible'));
      } else if('IntersectionObserver' in window){
        const obs = new IntersectionObserver((entries, o) => {
          entries.forEach(e => {
            if(e.isIntersecting){
              e.target.classList.add('visible');
              o.unobserve(e.target);
            }
          });
        },{threshold:0.12});
        reveals.forEach(r => obs.observe(r));
      } else {
        reveals.forEach(r => r.classList.add('visible'));
      }

      // Modal / Practice controls
      const overlay = document.getElementById('practice');
      const openBtn = document.getElementById('open-practice');
      const openBtn2 = document.getElementById('start-practice-2');
      const closeBtn = document.getElementById('close-practice');
      const modeBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.mode-btn');
      const panels = document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]');

      function openPractice(){
        overlay.classList.add('open');
        // focus modal
        overlay.querySelector('.modal').focus();
        document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
      }
      function closePractice(){
        overlay.classList.remove('open');
        document.body.style.overflow = '';
        stopBreath();
      }
      openBtn.addEventListener('click', openPractice);
      openBtn2.addEventListener('click', openPractice);
      closeBtn.addEventListener('click', closePractice);
      overlay.addEventListener('click', function(e){ if(e.target===overlay) closePractice(); });
      document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key==='Escape') closePractice(); });

      modeBtns.forEach(btn => btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        modeBtns.forEach(b=>{b.classList.remove('active');b.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');});
        btn.classList.add('active');btn.setAttribute('aria-selected','true');
        const mode = btn.dataset.mode;
        panels.forEach(p=>{ p.style.display = (p.dataset.panel===mode)?'block':'none'; });
      }));

      // Breathing mode: simple timed cycle
      const circle = document.getElementById('circle');
      const phase = document.getElementById('phase');
      const bar = document.getElementById('bar');
      const startBtn = document.getElementById('start-breath');
      const pauseBtn = document.getElementById('pause-breath');
      const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset-breath');

      let breathTimer = null;
      let cycle = 0; // progress of whole practice 0..1
      let running = false;
      // settings for a gentle 3-step cycle (inhale:4, hold:3, exhale:6)
      const phases = [ {name:'Inhale', dur:4000, cls:'inhale'}, {name:'Hold', dur:3000, cls:'hold'}, {name:'Exhale', dur:6000, cls:'exhale'} ];
      let pIndex = 0;
      let pStart = null;
      let practiceStart = null;

      function step(timestamp){
        if(!running) return;
        if(!pStart) pStart = timestamp;
        if(!practiceStart) practiceStart = timestamp;
        const p = phases[pIndex];
        const elapsed = timestamp - pStart;
        // update visual
        circle.classList.remove('inhale','hold','exhale');
        circle.classList.add(p.cls);
        phase.textContent = p.name;
        // progress overall
        const total = phases.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.dur,0);
        const overall = Math.min(1, (timestamp - practiceStart) / (total * 4)); // give 4 cycles default
        bar.style.width = Math.round(overall * 100) + '%';

        if(elapsed >= p.dur){
          // advance
          pIndex = (pIndex + 1) % phases.length;
          pStart = timestamp;
        }
        breathTimer = requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }

      function startBreath(){
        if(running) return;
        running = true; pIndex = 0; pStart = null; practiceStart = null;
        breathTimer = requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }
      function pauseBreath(){
        running = false; if(breathTimer) cancelAnimationFrame(breathTimer); breathTimer = null; phase.textContent = 'Paused';
      }
      function resetBreath(){
        pauseBreath(); pIndex = 0; pStart = null; practiceStart = null; circle.classList.remove('inhale','hold','exhale'); bar.style.width = '0%'; phase.textContent = 'Ready';
      }
      function stopBreath(){ resetBreath(); }

      startBtn.addEventListener('click', startBreath);
      pauseBtn.addEventListener('click', pauseBreath);
      resetBtn.addEventListener('click', resetBreath);

      // Journal controls
      const journal = document.getElementById('journal-text');
      const saveJournal = document.getElementById('save-journal');
      const clearJournal = document.getElementById('clear-journal');
      saveJournal.addEventListener('click', function(){
        localStorage.setItem('hm_journal', journal.value || '');
        saveJournal.textContent = 'Saved';
        setTimeout(()=>saveJournal.textContent='Save',1400);
      });
      clearJournal.addEventListener('click', function(){ journal.value=''; localStorage.removeItem('hm_journal'); });
      // Load saved
      try{ const s=localStorage.getItem('hm_journal'); if(s) journal.value = s; }catch(e){}

      // Intention controls
      const intentIn = document.getElementById('intention-input');
      const saveIntent = document.getElementById('save-intent');
      const clearIntent = document.getElementById('clear-intent');
      const intentSaved = document.getElementById('intent-saved');
      saveIntent.addEventListener('click', function(){
        const v = intentIn.value.trim();
        if(!v){ intentSaved.style.display='block'; intentSaved.textContent='Please enter an intention to save.'; return; }
        localStorage.setItem('hm_intent', v);
        intentSaved.style.display='block'; intentSaved.textContent='Saved: "' + v + '"';
        setTimeout(()=>intentSaved.style.display='none',2500);
      });
      clearIntent.addEventListener('click', function(){ intentIn.value=''; localStorage.removeItem('hm_intent'); intentSaved.style.display='none'; });
      // load saved
      try{ const t=localStorage.getItem('hm_intent'); if(t) intentIn.value = t; }catch(e){}

      // Simple form submit (no backend) — show local confirmation
      const form = document.getElementById('contact-form');
      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        const data = new FormData(form);
        // Minimal client-side validation
        if(!data.get('email') && !data.get('phone')){
          alert('Please include an email or phone number so we can follow up.');
          return;
        }
        // Mock send
        const name = data.get('name') || 'Friend';
        alert('Thanks, ' + name + '. We received your message and will follow up.');
        form.reset();
      });

      // Accessibility: trap focus inside modal when open
      document.addEventListener('focus', function(ev){
        if(!overlay.classList.contains('open')) return;
        if(!overlay.contains(ev.target)){
          ev.stopPropagation(); overlay.querySelector('.modal').focus();
        }
      }, true);

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk 4 — contact.html and README

Files included:
- contact.html : A complete contact page for the holistic_medicine site (slug: holistic_medicine-MORE-2026-02-17T21-23-43-866Z-040).

Purpose and highlights:
- Contact interface with a simple form, contact details using placeholders for {{PHONE}} and {{EMAIL}} and location placeholders {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.
- Guided exercise modal implemented in local JS only: three modes (Breathing, Journaling, Intention). No external assets or libraries.
  - Breathing mode: visual breathing circle and timed cycle using requestAnimationFrame; controls for Start / Pause / Reset.
  - Journaling mode: textarea with Save (stores to localStorage) and Clear.
  - Intention mode: small input with Save and Clear (stores to localStorage).
- Scroll-triggered reveal for sections using IntersectionObserver. Respects prefers-reduced-motion: if the user prefers reduced motion, sections reveal immediately with no animation.
- ARIA roles and basic accessibility considerations (modal role=dialog, focus handling, keyboard Escape to close).
- Uses a patterned background image reference to assets/img/pattern.svg; no external fonts, CDNs, or images shipped in this chunk.

How to test locally:
1. Place this file in your project root or appropriate page folder.
2. Open contact.html in a browser (no server required for basic testing).
3. Click "Try the short practice" to open the modal. Test the three modes.
4. Test the breathing animation and controls. Use the Escape key or Close button to dismiss.
5. To verify reduced-motion behavior: set your OS/browser to "Reduce Motion" and refresh — reveal animations should be disabled.
6. Use the form to test client-side validation (email or phone required) and mock submit.

Notes and constraints:
- Placeholders must remain as tokens: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.
- This chunk intentionally contains only the contact page and README. Other site assets (pattern.svg) should be provided in other chunks.
- Copy avoids the banned signature phrases and keeps an educational, supportive tone. No cures or guarantees are stated.

If you need variants (light theme, different CTA phrasing, or a version that wires the form to an API), I can produce an updated file."}
